    "lecture_num": 2,
    "lecture_name": "UI Building Practical with Gradio",
    "content": "UI Building Practical with Gradio\n\nModule: Full-Stack LLM Foundations\nLesson Type: Hands-on Lab\nLearning Outcomes\nBy the end of this lesson, you'll be able to:\nBuild a simple user interface using Gradio library in Python\nConnect your UI to an AI model using Groq's API\nUnderstand the full-stack architecture of AI applications (Frontend, Backend, AI Model)\nDeploy your first AI-powered chatbot to Hugging Face Spaces\nApply the OPT framework (Operating Model, Processes, Tasks) to identify automation opportunities\n2.1 Prerequisites and Setup\nBefore you begin building AI applications with code, you need to ensure you have the right tools installed and configured on your system. This lecture builds on the foundation laid in",
