    "content": "Why GitHub Export Mattered\nRemember last week when Lovable exported to GitHub? You might have thought: \"Why bother? I'm just prototyping.\"\nNow you see: That GitHub repo was already production-ready. The handoff wasn't Lovable → Cursor → \"someday production.\" It was Lovable → Cursor → deployed in 5 minutes.\nThe @codebase context in Cursor makes sense differently now.\nLast week you used @codebase to refine code locally. That code you refined? It runs the same way on Render. There's no \"translation step.\" Your localhost FastAPI app IS the production app.\n\nConnecting to",
