    "content": "FastAPI project right now without notes?\nIf yes, you're ready to ship your MVP independently.\nIf no, what's blocking you? Ask now. We'll debug together.\n\nCLOSING: THE GAP WAS NEVER TECHNICAL\nWe've been writing production code since",
